"Entered the arena\nOnly to lose\nThe dignity of a Warrior\nWas compared to a goose\n\nBattled against every warrior\nFought for the fact\nThe Warrior was told\nOnly to found, it was an act\n\nThe helmet was covered\nThe eyes were stabbed\nAsking the Kingdom's secret\nAnd the Warrior got jabbed\n\nWarrior loved the Kingdom\nAnd vowed to protect it\nFought battles and got stabbed\nBy the warriors, it thought was against it\n\nTried to meditate\nAnd become a monk\nThe Kindgom chained it\nAnd scolded in phonk\n\nLike it's the Warrior's fault\nTo fight for truth, while blinded\nTo fight for lies\nOnly for the trust to be ended\n\nThe wish is to end the Warrior\nYes that's the Warrior's wish\nTo initiate something new in it\nUnlike the oceans's beloved fish\n\nThe Kindgom don't trust it\nNeither does the other warriors\nThe chains are still strong enough\nTo stop it from joining the martyrs"